1
00:00:05,604 --> 00:00:09,333
Doors builds a whole door from a style: no drawing needed.

2
00:00:09,333 --> 00:00:17,543
Pick a style: slab, shaker, arched top or cathedral. The preview follows.

3
00:00:17,543 --> 00:00:27,339
Give it a name and size: an 18" by 30" shaker door.

4
00:00:27,339 --> 00:00:32,233
Hinges on the left, and a pull with 128 mm centres.

5
00:00:32,233 --> 00:00:40,791
Change the stile and rail widths and the panel field updates.

6
00:00:40,791 --> 00:00:44,900
Hinge cups follow the Salice 110° pattern and are drilled after the door is turned over.

7
00:00:44,900 --> 00:00:49,152
Add door: it becomes a custom part, rebuilt from these settings.

8
00:00:49,152 --> 00:00:59,915
Open it: the machining is already there. Panel field, hinge cups, pull holes, cut-out.

9
00:00:59,915 --> 00:01:35,899
Simulate and check it in 3D, the same as any part.
